stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Loaded: load(BIL1)
  Loaded --> Ran: run
  Ran --> Disposed: dispose / zeroize
  Loaded --> Disposed: dispose
  Disposed --> Loaded: load next job
  Loaded --> Idle: LoadError_Busy if second flight
  note right of Ran
    SoftISA: Vm::run or bil_isa.c via MMIO
  end note
